+Refs #608 #645 #647 #667 #682 #686 #691. Operator [A578]. These are operator observations.
+
+The [B14 assignment](https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/issues/608#issuecomment-6085135051) defines this findings-only lane.
+The image is dev `5603c353`, seed eppo, as flashed.
+The [ruling of 2026-10-10](https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/issues/608#issuecomment-6094000332) runs it without the SoC board.
