+The other 29 rows were first read at 06:22, after items 2 to 4 had changed and restored state, so their basis is the 06:22 inventory, not an as-found read.
+The 15 as-found rows cover every item this lane changed.
+The DUT's maps read 4 and 8 mappings, as found.
+`MAAP_STAT0` and `MAAP_STAT1` are unchanged.
