+    "sw/firmware/ctrl/test/ctrl_mutant.py": "the campaign tables' record of one defect; it compiles nothing",
+    "sw/firmware/ctrl_nvm/test/nvm_mutants.py": "the saved-state store campaign's planted defects, which "
